        "TileImage": "$($repository ee2af034-8ebe-43f8-a8f3-525e060dbb31).Image",
        "Description": "The plot to assassinate prominent industry mogul and racing driver Moses Lee has almost been foiled. You targets are The Middleman, a race marshal who Kronstadt bribed to fix explosives onto Lee&apos;s car, and The Blackmailer, a man with knowledge of the plot who threatens to expose the attempt unless paid a hefty sum. But be careful; The Middleman is currently under intense interrogation and is therefore heavily guarded. I will leave you to prepare.",
